{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.20]Yeah\n[00:01.24]Fentanyl and Xan both, damn\n[00:05.14]Diamonds and a Moncler (Beep)\n[00:08.12]Yeah (Beep, beep)\n[00:11.20]Uh (Grah)\n[Chorus]\n[00:11.76]Walking 'round Atlanta in a purple Moncler (Yeah, yeah, yeah, what?)\n[00:14.72]Money long, blonde hair, I don’t care (Yeah, yeah, yeah, what?)\n[00:17.68]Ain't that your lil' girlfriend standing over there? (Yeah, yeah, yeah, what?)\n[00:20.58]She walked over to my chair (Yeah, yeah, yeah, let’s go!)\n[00:23.54]Then she start to dirty dance, her hands down my pants (Yeah, yeah, yeah, what else?)\n[00:26.22]Dick her down like my name Dirty Dan, just call me Dirty Dan (Yeah, yeah, yeah, what else?)\n[00:29.42]She gon' twerk for these bands, she gon' hit a handstand (Yeah, yeah, uh-huh, what else?)\n[00:32.44]Hollow tips ricochet, hit him then they hit his mans (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[Post-Chorus]\n[00:36.06]Drip too hard, my Saint Laurent (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[00:37.94]Barack Obama state of mind, nigga, \"Yes, we can\" (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[00:40.90]Especially when all these haters said, \"No, I can't\" (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[00:44.40]MVP, rookie of the year, the goddamn champ (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:47.84]She wanna fuck all night long, ready, set, go (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:50.40]Blow up in that bitch face (Uh), I confetti that ho\n[00:53.06]150 for a show, count the fetty then I'm gone (Uh-huh)\n[00:56.42]150 be the gang, NLMB we coming strong (Let's go, let's go, let's go!)\n[00:59.22]She said she wanna love me, I told her to leave my heart alone (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[01:02.26]I hate it when I start to care about these evil ass hoes (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[01:05.02]I know that they don’t love me, they just want my fucking cash flow (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[01:07.92]These hoes manipulate to gather money and that’s wrong (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[01:11.32]But who am I to judge? I used to rob and jug and hit them stains (Yeah, yeah, Jug!)\n[01:14.12]I can't blame another motherfucker for doing the same thing (Yeah!)\n[01:16.76]Especially when you broke, that’s the—worst pain (Uh-huh!)\n[01:19.84]But off me, bae, money you will not make\n[01:23.24]Oh, ain't that the truth, I'm preaching, have a church, oh (Uh-huh)\n[01:26.50]For that bag, these hoes taking they shirts—off (Uh-huh)\n[01:29.88]Even teach they self how to squirt, oh (Uh-huh)\n[01:32.72]I had to expose them, guess I'm a jerk, oh\n[Chorus]\n[01:34.28]Walking ’round Atlanta in a purple Moncler (What?)\n[01:37.18]Money long, blonde hair, I don't care (Yeah, yeah, yeah, uh-huh)\n[01:40.12]Ain't that your lil' girlfriend standing over there? (Yeah, yeah, yeah, uh-huh)\n[01:43.40]She walked over to my chair (Yeah, yeah, yeah, uh-huh)\n[01:46.00]Then she start to dirty dance, her hands down my pants (Yeah, yeah, yeah, what?)\n[01:48.84]Dick her down like my name Dirty Dan, just call me Dirty Dan (Yeah, yeah, yeah, what?)\n[01:51.86]She gon' twerk for these bands, she gon' hit a handstand (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[01:54.66]Hollow tips ricochet, hit him then they hit his mans (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:58.80]Uh, ayy, count that cash up (Cash)\n[02:00.80]Uh, I'm too ahead, they can't catch up (Skrrt)\n[02:04.04]Team too ahead, they can't catch us (Gang, gang)\n[02:06.58]Fifty shots to his head, he need back up, for real\n[02:10.04]I don't like toting guns, but I may have to shoot to kill (For real)\n[02:12.82]Niggas hate that I'm winning, they don't wanna see me live (Uh, uh, uh, uh, yeah)\n[02:15.78]They too lazy to get it, it's a lot of shit to give up (Uh, uh, uh, uh, yeah)\n[02:18.74]Just stay focused on your mission, and don't ever, ever give up (Yeah)\n[02:21.66]Codeine and the oxycodone really fuckin' up my liver\n[02:24.48]My family scared of me overdosin', I know that shit give 'em shivers (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:27.86]But don't worry, tell 'em God got me, just to uplift 'em\n[02:30.36]But deep inside, sometimes, I wonder if God can even hear us\n[02:33.66]But I'ma keep praying (Uh)\n[02:35.36]I'ma keep hope up\n[02:36.84]I'ma keep faith (What else?)\n[02:38.18]Still gon' be a pistol-toter\n[02:39.72]Shoot him in his face (Brah)\n[02:40.94]If he get in the way of the cake (Grrah)\n[02:42.26]Heat him up, I feel like a thermometer\n[02:43.46]If it's a problem, I'm pulling out, nigga get baked (Let's go, let's go, let's go!)\n[Chorus]\n[02:45.86]Walking 'round Atlanta in a purple Moncler (What?)\n[02:47.84]Money long, blonde hair, I don't care (Yeah, yeah, yeah, uh-huh)\n[02:50.80]Ain't that your lil' girlfriend standing over there? (Yeah, yeah, yeah, uh-huh)\n[02:54.26]She walked over to my chair (Yeah, yeah, yeah, uh-huh)\n[02:56.66]Then she start to dirty dance, her hands down my pants (Yeah, yeah, yeah, what?)\n[02:59.52]Dick her down like my name Dirty Dan, just call me Dirty Dan (Yeah, yeah, yeah, what?)\n[03:02.42]She gon' twerk for these bands, she gon' hit a handstand (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[03:05.34]Hollow tips ricochet, hit him then they hit his mans (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[Post-Chorus]\n[03:08.42]Drip too hard, my Saint Laurent (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[03:11.08]Barack Obama state of mind, nigga, \"Yes, we can\" (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[03:14.04]Especially when all these haters said, \"No, I can't\" (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[03:17.48]MVP, rookie of the year, the goddamn champ (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)","words":[[0.2,0.94,"Yeah"],[1.24,2.4,"Fentanyl"],[2.44,2.56,"and"],[2.9,3.1,"Xan"],[3.28,4.34,"both,"],[4.52,4.88,"damn"],[5.14,5.86,"Diamonds"],[5.94,6.02,"and"],[6.06,6.06,"a"],[6.2,6.74,"Moncler"],[6.8,8.08,"(Beep)"],[8.12,8.4,"Yeah"],[8.46,8.8,"(Beep,"],[8.94,10.88,"beep)"],[11.2,11.38,"Uh"],[11.46,11.72,"(Grah)"],[11.76,12.0,"Walking"],[12.04,12.32,"'round"],[12.38,12.76,"Atlanta"],[12.94,13.02,"in"],[13.1,13.1,"a"],[13.2,13.5,"purple"],[13.6,14.12,"Moncler"],[14.16,14.22,"(Yeah,"],[14.26,14.32,"yeah,"],[14.36,14.42,"yeah,"],[14.48,14.68,